  "bodyHash": "3baaf69ae45b9e4e",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">儲物袋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 為《Minecraft》增添了魔法便攜式存儲功能。使用時尚的袋子攜帶物品，隨處存取，減少整理雜亂背包的時間。🎒</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">您可以選擇三種不同等級的袋子，容量逐漸增加，從緊湊的皮質錢包到能容納整個建築項目的巨大金袋。您可以直接從快捷欄打開袋子，或在背包界面中無縫操作它們。✨</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">本模組靈感來自現代的捆綁機制，允許您瀏覽內容、插入物品、精確提取所需物品，而無需頻繁打開單獨的菜單。強大的工具提示預覽和直觀的控制讓每個袋子都變得快速便捷。🎯</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">對於重視自己物品的冒險者來說，袋子甚至可以附魔 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">保全</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，使其在死亡時得以倖存（代價是消耗附魔等級）。💎</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎒 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">三種袋子等級：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 製作皮革、鐵和金袋子，擁有逐漸增加的存儲容量以滿足您的需求。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📦 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">基於背包的存儲訪問：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 無需打開專屬界面，即可直接向袋子中插入或提取物品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔍 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">詳細內容預覽：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 直接在物品工具提示中查看存儲內容，一目了然地瞭解每個袋子裡裝了什麼。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎯 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">選擇任何存儲物品：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 使用滾輪或鍵盤方向鍵，精確選擇要交互的存儲物品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📝 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">選定物品詳情：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 在瀏覽袋子內容時，即時查看當前選中物品的信息。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">↔️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">快速物品轉移：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 利用直觀的背包交互功能，快速插入和提取物品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🖱️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">跨多個槽位拖拽：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 點擊並拖拽跨越多個背包槽位，批量插入或提取物品，大幅提高管理效率。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎚️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">精確物品移動：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 按住 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Control</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 鍵（Mac 上為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Command</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 鍵）可移動單個物品而非整組，精確控制轉移數量。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💡 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">智能兼容性指示器：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 視覺提示顯示手中的物品是否可以插入，以及內部是否已存在匹配的物品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🪄 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">專用袋子界面：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 隨時從快捷欄打開袋子，享受傳統的存儲屏幕體驗。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">保全附魔：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 通過附魔「保全」保護袋子，防止其在死亡時丟失。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚙️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">高度可配置：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 自定義存儲容量、交互方式、控制設置、工具提示行為和視覺效果，以匹配您的遊戲風格。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/media/4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客戶端和服務器均需安裝</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> （Fabric 和 NeoForge）**</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> （Fabric）**</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> （Fabric）**</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如果模組支持，可以通過遊戲內的模組菜單直接進行配置（Fabric 平台需要安裝由 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 開發的 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模組）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若使用外部文本編輯器進行手動配置，所有文件均位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 目錄下，文件名分別為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，具體取決於配置文件類型。並非所有模組都包含所有類型的配置文件。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/rwtema\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">RWTema</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 的靈感啟發，該模組源自其早期版本 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-utilities\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Extra Utilities</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模組中的儲物袋物品。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">衷心感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/nyffuuuh23\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Nyffuuuh23</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 製作了這些精美的紋理！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/easy-shulker-boxes\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/bartering-station\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/barteringstation/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/magnum-torch\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/magnumtorch/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
